│ 10 and 25 mg/day) had more dropouts than the groups taking 50 mg acitretin or 50 mg etretinate. Complete remissions  │
│ before the end of therapy occurred only among those receiving higher doses. Enlargement of psoriatic lesions,        │
│ however, could be observed during treatment with both retinoids, despite improvement of other parameters, as         │
