│ proportion of records that needed resolving by an expert. RESULTS The Cochrane Crowd community currently has 18,897  │
│ contributors from 163 countries. Collectively, the Crowd has processed 1,021,227 records, helping to identify        │
│ 178,437 reports of randomized controlled trials (RCTs) for Cochrane\'s Central Register of Controlled Trials. The    │
