mg/kg) cyclosporin A: treatment of psoriasis and investigation of the influence on lipid profile", "abstract": "This    
study was designed to investigate the therapeutical efficacy of a comparatively low dose cyclosporin A (1.25 mg/kg/day) 
in the treatment of psoriasis and to assess the influence of cyclosporin A on lipid profiles. In the first, double-blind
