│ meta‐analysis", "objective": "To compare the benefits and harms of non‐biological systemic agents, small molecules,  │
│ and biologics for people with moderate‐to‐severe psoriasis using a network meta‐analysis, and to provide a ranking   │
│ of these treatments according to their benefits and harms.", "background": "Psoriasis is an immune‐mediated disease  │
│ with either skin or joints manifestations, or both, and it has a major impact on quality of life. Although there is  │
│ currently no cure for psoriasis, various treatment strategies allow sustained control of disease signs and symptoms. │
│ The relative benefit of these treatments remains unclear due to the limited number of trials comparing them directly │
